                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I like the premise, but for 1.0 release, this is quite disappointing mostly because of these three things:\n\n- Graphical / Sound settings are not properly saved\n- Game gets (graphically) stuck at dawn every once in a while and requires you to reload\n- Night is too long and too dark to properly see what you are doing\n\nThis is something I would be able to understand for an Early Access title, but for a full release with 1.0, these things are a clear oversight. Please fix these bugs and until they are fixed, I wouldn't recommend buying this right now.",
